    "chunk_text": "dominum in omni tempore usque in finem, & benedicite & letanias Gif sceap sy abrocen, & wi\u00f0 f\u00e6rsteorfan, c\u00e6ster\u00e6sc, elehtre, wulfescamb, finol, stancrop, wyrc to Wi\u00f0 poccum & sceapa hreoflan, elehtre & eoforfearn neo\u00f0weard, sperewyrt ufanwearde, agrundene Wi\u00f0 swina f\u00e6rsteorfan, do a in heora mete, seo\u00f0 clitan, syle etan, nim eac elehtran, bisceopwyrt & Wi\u00f0 \u00feeofentum, luben luben niga efi\u00f0 niga efi\u00f0 fel ceid fel, delf fel cumer orcggaei ceufor dard giug Wi\u00f0 hondwyrmmum, scipteron, swefl, pipor, hwit sealt, m\u00e6ngc tosomne, smyre mid. Eft, wex, swefl, & sealt, m\u00e6ngc, smyre mid. Gif n\u00e6gl of honda weor\u00f0e, nim hw\u00e6tene corn, gecnuca, m\u00e6ngc wi\u00f0 hunig, lege on \u00f0one finger, wyll Wi\u00f0 hwostan, wyll curmeallan wyrtruman, wyrc to duste, syle him on wine drincan, sona se hwosta Wi\u00f0 maganwyrce & gif he bi\u00f0 toblawen se inno\u00f0, wringc pollegian in ceald w\u00e6ter o\u00f0\u00f0e in win, syle Wi\u00f0 \u00f0on \u00f0e wif f\u00e6runga adumbige, genim pollegian & gnid to duste & in wulle bewind, alege under Wi\u00f0 \u00feeor, rose & rude, elene & feferfuge, r\u00e6dic & bisceopwyrt, saluie & sauine, efer\u00f0rote. Eft o\u00feer, fane & feferfuge, garleac & r\u00e6dic, ellenrind inneweard & cyrse, netele, pipor,",
